# Project memory

`memory-important-infos.md` at the repository root is the durable memory for this project.

- Read it before changing the product, releases, languages, or repository setup.
- Update it in the same session when the user says not to forget something, or when a lasting decision changes.
- Record the decision and why it matters. Remove facts that are no longer true.
- Do not store secrets, tokens, or passwords.

## Example

The user says the app must stay macOS-only. Add that under Do not forget, and correct any section that says otherwise.
